        "raw": "<p>It is number 1. What wording would remove the ambiguity? Remember we also want the Invaders to possibly deal damage in different lands.</p><p>(I believe it&#39;s also intended that a single City could kill three Explorers in three different adjacent lands, i.e., splitting up its damage.)</p>",
